{"parse": {"title": "红墙-05", "pageid": 65750, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-04\" title=\"红墙-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">红墙-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-06\" title=\"红墙-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">红墙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E8.89.B2.E6.9A.B4.E8.A1.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血色暴行\">血色暴行</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 血色暴行</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哈……“小草莓”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>真是个好名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前表演赛的一切都是牛仔之夜骑牛环节的缩小版，只除了护栏边上那头亟待征服的公牛本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它体型庞大，周身的灰色疤点连成斑驳的片状，蹄子正不耐烦地踢踏着沙地。阿尔古斯看过它的资料，早在两个月前，其重量就已经是自己的二十倍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小草莓”：</div><div>吽——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿、嘿！伙计，别这样，离我远点儿。我可不是不知死活要挑战你的那个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>公牛几乎把围栏边的观众都顶了个遍。没有人愿意再呆在那周围，都站得远远的。毕竟观赏不自量力者的死状只是蛮荒生活的一针余兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>说真的，小姐，我还是不建议你跟那家伙打这个赌——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>鉴于我们不能收殓没结婚的女人，到时候，你就只能被埋在杏子林下头，或者丢在荒野里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>只有男人能骑牛哈？少废话，给我把它牵过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>然后接下来的一百年里，我死还是残废都不需要你们负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>……唉。给，拿好绳子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>在我数三之后，把它挂上小草莓脖子上的金属扣。记住，一定要看准扣稳再骑上去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>动作要快，不要去看它的角，也不要盯着地面，没抓住绳索的手上举。看见这块牌子了吗？我们会从你屁股贴上牛背的时候开始倒计时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-627301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>行了，没听见她是个行家吗？你只需要把绳子甩过去，剩下的交给上帝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-627411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅱ：</div><div>快开始吧，这白炽灯很废电……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一束人工光直直打在阿尔古斯眼皮上，让她感觉自己是暴露在汽车探照灯下的鹿，或是审讯中的犯人。她不明白在白天这样设置的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她也没多说话，踩上护栏弯腰从牛的肚子下方捞起绳索，接着轻轻拉拽。绳索比想象中要粗糙和结实，她怀疑现在这双手套会在结束后报废。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>准备好了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>随时都行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>好。三，二，一——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>开始！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铜管猛地敲响铁牌，几乎同时，阿尔古斯也稳当地把屁股放在了公牛灰棕相间的脊背上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小草莓”：</div><div>哞——哞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一秒，“小草莓”立刻背着她向围场中间冲刺。它一边抽搐着扭动，以近乎螺旋的方式跳跃、前进，只为将背上的“苍蝇”甩下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而阿尔古斯却双手都死死抓住了扣绳。她铰住，随公牛跳跃的节奏铰住绳索，一圈，一圈，又一圈，直到捆得与手连成一体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嘿——嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>伙计——咳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>三——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第三秒，她在颠簸中咬了自己的舌头。这使雇佣兵意识到自己实际上不该发出任何声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绳索很快磨开了手套，在掌心也撕裂之前，虎口是最快渗出血来的部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小草莓”：</div><div>吽！吽吽！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德？：</div><div>五——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第五秒，她什么也看不清，咬住牙齿直到牙根都发酸。脑子里模糊地漂浮着思绪：野牛似乎没有这样大和烈性的品种，也许是非洲水牛与本地品种的杂交。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她依然能感觉到手中绳索逐渐因为血液和汗水而变得粘稠。很快它们就不再像开始那样容易握住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是她只能用力，更用力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德？：</div><div>七——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第七秒，她感觉铜管敲击在铁牌上的声音几乎是响在自己脑子里。由于肌肉过载，身体开始像嗑嗨了一样发抖，大汗淋漓，手上几乎就要松开绳索。她控制不住——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-625220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德？：</div><div>——坚持——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嗬……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>代表第九秒的敲击声落下，阿尔古斯同时松开了双手，任由躯体沉重地摔在沙地里。所幸着地的并非头颅，而是肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落地时，四周万籁俱寂，雇佣兵短暂失去视觉，却敏锐地意识到此刻所有人的目光都聚集在自己身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-628101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“小草莓”：</div><div>哞——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_yuanye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_yuanye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以至于公牛回头的一瞬，她突然也回光返照似的睁眼，用不停震颤的、破碎的双手支撑着站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在被牛蹄踏断脊梁之前，在自己能找到凯拉之前——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯猛地奔跑起来。她翻过围栏，冲向农场主所在位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>耶稣基督——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>我*……她真的做到了……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-627310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>整个德州的新秀赛冠军都只能在它背上坚持八秒——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——几秒？我坚持了几秒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>说话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她狂奔过去，声音嘶哑，几乎是抠着喉咙在问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>有十秒！有十秒对不对，你们都看见了——你们都看见了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你们——最好不是想要抵赖——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>不，你很勇敢，但是……但是很抱歉，你只在牛背上坚持了九秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>铜管只在铁牌上敲了九下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>什——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>很遗憾，你输了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-625201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">韦德：</div><div>只差一秒，是的，我们都看见了。所以……我会将结果如实转告给亚当。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……哈。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>入夜之后，白日的喧嚷散去，两对不同的脚印沉默着涉向浅滩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今天锤在围栏上的拳头还在隐隐发痛，但阿尔古斯此刻无暇顾及这些小事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>从这里往前，过了浅滩继续前进两百码，看到一扇只剩半边的雕花铁门，那之后，就是红墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我只能带你到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……谢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我没想到你能在牛背上坚持九秒，现在很少看到你这么固执的人了。如果我当初也固执一点——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>算了，现在说这些也没有用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你本来也可以什么都不告诉我的，却还是说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我保留姐姐的信息，你得到墙的位置，一半一半吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>就当你用表演赛的奖金换的。祝你好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>好，祝我好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>对了，韦德胆子不大，别弄出大动静吓唬他。今天你在围场边上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>行了，我比你闯荡得久，知道分寸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>告别了亚当，阿尔古斯独自继续。尽管她几乎什么也看不见，只是凭感觉向前走去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在铁门之后，阿尔古斯能感觉到天气越发晴朗。萤火虫擦过她的手腕，又隐匿进灌木丛之中。她只能看见朦朦的光点，分不清任何轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像她的心情一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>血腥味越来越重了……方向没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>得睁大眼睛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯摸出一颗苦目糖用来赶路。不知不觉间，她吃糖的方式早已从咀嚼变为了吞咽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有更多时间可以浪费了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>一面墙的轮廓……有月光……但还是不够清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>没法儿判断固体物是什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>呼……那么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>瞬息之后，又见星光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯一边继续向前，一边发动了神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在属于神秘术的辉光短暂照亮之后，“红墙”暴露在真实的视野里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嗯——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这些血——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>怎么会有这么多血？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "红墙-05"}}